-- title:
--   Elementary words over Dᵥ rewritten over Λ[1/p] times a unit
-- statement:
--   Let $D$ be a ring equipped with a $\mathbb{Q}$-algebra structure and let $\Lambda \subseteq D$ be a $\mathbb{Z}$-submodule which contains $1$, is closed under multiplication ($x,y \in \Lambda \Rightarrow xy \in \Lambda$) and spans $D$ as a $\mathbb{Q}$-vector space; finite generation is not assumed. Let $p$ be a prime and let $v$ be a height-one prime of the ring of integers $\mathcal{O}_{\mathbb{Q}}$ whose prime ideal contains the image of $p$; write $D_v = D \otimes_{\mathbb{Q}} \mathbb{Q}_v$ for the base change to the $v$-adic completion of $\mathbb{Q}$, and let $\Lambda_v \subseteq D_v$ be the additive subgroup generated by the elementary tensors $z \otimes c$ with $z \in \Lambda$ and $c$ in the valuation ring of the completion at $v$. Then for every finite list $l$ of pairs $(b, a) \in \mathrm{Bool} \times D_v$ there are a finite list $l'$ of pairs $(b', \alpha) \in \mathrm{Bool} \times D$ with each $\alpha$ satisfying $p^n \alpha \in \Lambda$ for some $n \in \mathbb{N}$, and matrices $X, Y \in M_2(D_v)$ all of whose entries lie in $\Lambda_v$, with $XY = YX = 1$, such that the product over $l$ of the elementary matrices $\begin{pmatrix} 1 & a \\ 0 & 1\end{pmatrix}$ (when $b$ is true) resp. $\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\ a & 1\end{pmatrix}$ (when $b$ is false) equals the corresponding product of elementary matrices with entries $\alpha \otimes 1$ taken over $l'$, multiplied on the right by $X$.
--
--   This is the strong-approximation step at a single finite place in the form needed for elementary $2 \times 2$ matrices: any word in elementary matrices over $D_v$ is a word in elementary matrices with entries from $\Lambda[1/p] \otimes 1$ times a matrix that is a unit of $M_2(\Lambda_v)$. It is used in the treatment of maximal orders in quaternion algebras, in the characterisation of the lattices cut out by finite ideles with trivial component away from one place.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_Submodule_exists_list_prod_elementary_tmul_one_mul_eq_of_mem_asIdeal.lean

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_Submodule_LocalBox

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
